# Mods' builds land in their folders (docs/MODDING.md); only sources and data are kept.
/mods/*/*.dll
/mods/*/*.pdb
/mods/*/src/*/bin/
/mods/*/src/*/obj/

# Agent worktrees (Claude Code): working copies, never part of the repository.
/.claude/worktrees/

# The capsule contact sheet (tools/capsules.py): a working file for judging, rebuilt every run.
